      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FANTASTIC SPIKE (2) was in the placings last time but shapes well for this on his dynamic win the start prior, getting around Murray Bridge over 530m in 29.64. Rates on top and can find winning form again. AMRON TIGER (1) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 5 lengths (31.01) at this track. Should be in this for a long way. PAW LEON (4) missed the frame latest when sixth at this track (31.36) but was a winner four back in the second best time of the program. Comes out of a solid form race last start. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. DAKOTA SHINE (6) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a Invitation at this track over 530m.",
